 to  test our push the art further we studied  the old mill the Disney old mill short  to like see how they approached rain and  storms and no just did the whole idea of  the the weather change was like we  always give ourselves as many challenges  throughout the game and that's why we do  stuff like water in the harbor stage or  you know crazy splashes on the mermaid  stage we just for some gave ourselves  like many challenges to I guess that's  what I was searching for what's us like  there's a black and white Mickey was one  that's not it's not that ghosts wonder  what the mad doctor unless it is but it  starts like it's a mad dog he's at the  Med doctor that starts outside yeah and  like closes umbrella way and then yeah  yeah we really liked the look of like  how they animated the rain and it was  their lightening effect which is like  just simply flashing away but it looked  so good in that cartoon that we're like  what boss would work well with rain and  how can we throw in a thunderstorm and  then we're like I know it'll be easy  just make the final form change  everything in the background  [Music]  you  [Music]

